                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Na tazama, mtu mmoja miongoni mwa wana wa Israeli akaja na kuwaletea nduguze mwanamke Mmidiani mbele ya macho ya Musa, na mbele ya macho ya mkutano wote wa wana wa Israeli, hapo walipokuwa walia mbele ya mlango wa hema ya kukutania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
